WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.766 --> 00:00:07.531
STAN LEE
I love being with people

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.977
It's the most incredible thing in the world.

00:00:11.969 --> 00:00:12.492
PETER PARKER
What are you doing?

00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:14.836
Oh, this is nice.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:18.321
STAN LEE
That world may change and evolve.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.289
But the one thing that will never change,

00:00:23.078 --> 00:00:25.907
we're all part of one big family.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.195
GROOT
We

00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:31.999
are

00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:35.156
Groot.

00:00:40.016 --> 00:00:41.359
STAN LEE
That man next to you,

00:00:42.078 --> 00:00:42.891
he's your brother.

00:00:43.859 --> 00:00:45.063
That woman over there,

00:00:45.094 --> 00:00:46.531
she's your sister.

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:47.813
CAROL DANVERS
Higher, further, faster, baby!

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:48.602
MARIA RAMBEAU
That's right!

00:00:53.023 --> 00:00:55.312
STAN LEE
We're all part of one Universe.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.874
BLACK PANTHER
Wakanda forever!

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.210
STAN LEE
That moves ever upward

00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:02.890
and onward to greater glory!

00:01:13.944 --> 00:01:14.507
FALCON
On your left.

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:24.124
[AUDIENCE CHEERING]

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:25.460
CAPTAIN AMERICA
AVENGERS!

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:31.069
[AUDIENCE CHEERING]

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:31.819
CAPTAIN AMERICA
Assemble!

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:35.804
[AUDIENCE CHEERING]

00:01:50.904 --> 00:01:52.169
BLACK WIDOW
I've lived a lot of lives,

00:01:57.664 --> 00:01:59.352
but I’m done running from my past.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.906
We have unfinished business.

00:02:03.062 --> 00:02:03.648
YELENA BELOVA
Who's we?

00:02:20.484 --> 00:02:21.808
When you love something

00:02:22.437 --> 00:02:23.398
you fight for it.

00:02:30.315 --> 00:02:32.025
We're the ones who changed everything.

